# RONDB-1120 Phase 2: block-level protocol and state-machine cases driven
# directly against DblqhProxy / DBLQH (node_failure_test_plan.md section 5).
# Currently section 5.3, TD-1 .. TD-8: proxy teardown idempotence, RELEASE
# identity validation and the SETUP owner-list validation.  Needs error
# inserts 5136 and 5146 and the leak-check DUMPs 2361 / 2363, which crash a
# node on a leak; the program prints PASSED or FAILED.
--source include/have_ndb.inc
--source include/have_debug.inc
--source include/have_ndb_debug.inc

--echo Running testCteProtocol
--exec $NDB_PUSH_AGG_DIR/testCteProtocol -c "$NDB_CONNECTSTRING" -m $MASTER_MYPORT
